  "description": "Server-side SDK of the self-hosted Session Replay backend (Immons.Tools.Maui.SessionReplay / Immons.Tools.Blazor.SessionReplay): unhandled exceptions of ASP.NET Core requests (caught before an error-handling middleware swallows them), ILogger errors with an exception (de-duplicated), unobserved task exceptions and a manual capture API — with the request context (method, route template, status, duration, user ids from claims, never bodies or headers), file:line from the PDBs next to the app, version/commit/host. Links every error to the client session that sent the request (X-Session-Replay header from the MAUI / Blazor SDKs). Asynchronous, buffered and rate-limited: never blocks a request, never fails the app when the backend is down. Hangfire jobs: Immons.Tools.AspNetCore.SessionReplay.Hangfire.",
